out by the main contractor at no cost to us.</li>\n      <li>Access, working platform, dewatering, and site preparation suitable for our equipment are to be provided by the main contractor at no cost to us.</li>\n      <li>Survey setting-out and any headroom constraints are to be clarified prior to work commencement.</li>\n      <li>Provision and overtime costs related to Resident Engineers (RE) and RTOs shall be borne by the main contractor.</li>\n      <li>Instrumentation, monitoring works, and PE supervision concerning existing structures and tunnels shall be provided by the main contractor.</li>\n      <li>Work shall be completed in a single phase without stoppage; standby charges will apply in case of delay or disruption.</li>\n      <li>NCE Submission, Cable Detection, POWS, Impact Assessment, DBC submission by Main Con.</li>\n    </ol>\n\n    <div class=\"term-sec-header\">2. TENDER PRICE</div>\n    <ol class=\"term-list\">\n      <li>The tender price is detailed in the BQ; actual payment will be based on site measurements.</li>\n      <li>Any work not specified in our scope is deemed excluded.</li>\n    </ol>\n\n    <div class=\"term-sec-header\">3. GOODS AND SERVICES TAX (GST)</div>\n    <ol class=\"term-list\">\n      <li>All rates and prices are exclusive of GST; GST will be charged if applicable.</li>\n    </ol>\n\n    <div class=\"term-sec-header\">8. TERMS OF PAYMENT</div>\n    <ol class=\"term-list\">\n      <li>Monthly progress claims to be submitted by the end of the month; payment within 26days upon issuance of payment cert or invoice.</li>\n      <li>Late payments are subject to 2% monthly interest.</li>\n    </ol>\n\n    <table class=\"sig-table\">\n      <tr>\n        <td>\n          <div class=\"sig-head\">Prepared By</div>\n          <div class=\"sig-box-img\"><svg width=\"100\" height=\"30\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 30\"><path d=\"M10,20 C25,5 35,30 55,10 C75,30 85,10 95,18\" stroke=\"#003366\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" fill=\"none\"/></svg></div>\n     